[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:He Often does This]
[00:14.59]What had happened to the writer's bag?
[00:20.49]After I had had lunch at a village pub,
[00:24.25]I looked for my bag.
[00:27.44]I had left it on a chair beside the door and now it wasn't there!
[00:34.73]As I was looking for it, the landlord came in.
[00:40.13]'Did you have a good meal?' he asked.
[00:44.47]'Yes, thank you,' I answered,
[00:47.79]'but I can't pay the bill. I haven't got my bag.'
[00:53.64]The landlord smiled
[00:53.64]and immediately went out.
[00:59.33]In a few minutes he returned with my bag
[01:02.78]and gave it back to me.
[01:05.38]'I'm very sorry,' he said.
[01:08.80]'My dog had taken it into the garden.
[01:12.54]He often does this!'
